NOTE ON THE ORIGINAL SOURCE

This add-on is a from-scratch Python/Blender re-implementation ported from
the behavior of the Blockbench plugin "Text Generator" by SirJain
(https://github.com/SirJain0/TextGenerator). That original project does not
declare a license (no LICENSE file, no license field in its metadata). No
original JavaScript source code is redistributed in the addon/ directory of
this project; the original file is kept only for reference under
original_source/ and is not covered by the GPL-3.0 terms above. See
docs/porting-notes.md for details and for contact information if the
original author wishes to specify terms.
